现有函数和失败输入如下：
```js
function csvCell(value) {
  const text = String(value ?? '');
  return text.includes(',') ? `"${text}"` : text;
}
```
输入数组是 ['CVE-7', 'lib"core', '1.0']。

完整函数如下：
```js
function fallbackScore(record) {
  const candidates = [record.nvd?.score, record.ghsa?.score, record.vendor?.score];
  return candidates.find((value) => typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value)) ?? null;
}
```

比较器和排序约定完整如下：
```js
const order = { CRITICAL: 4, HIGH: 3, MEDIUM: 2, LOW: 1, UNKNOWN: 0 };
export function compareSeverity(a, b) {
  return order[b] - order[a];
}
```
测试框架是 Vitest。

现有实现和快照如下：
```js
export function header() {
  return ['vulnerability_id', 'package_name', 'installed_version', 'fixed_version', 'severity', 'cvss_score'];
}
```
快照期望：vulnerability_id,package_name,installed_version,fixed_version,severity,cvss_score

当前循环实现为：
```js
export function toRows(findings) {
  const rows = [];
  findings.forEach((v) => {
    rows.push({ id: v.VulnerabilityID, package: v.PkgName, severity: v.Severity });
  });
  return rows;
}
```

完整类型、实现和编译器错误如下：
```ts
type Severity = 'CRITICAL' | 'HIGH' | 'MEDIUM' | 'LOW';
type Vulnerability = { Severity?: Severity };
const rank: Record<Severity, number> = { CRITICAL: 4, HIGH: 3, MEDIUM: 2, LOW: 1 };
function severityRank(item: Vulnerability): number {
  return rank[item.Severity];
}
```
TS2538: Type 'undefined' cannot be used as an index type.

当前类型和函数为：
```ts
type RawFinding = { VulnerabilityID: string; FixedVersion?: string };
function toRow(finding: RawFinding) {
  return { id: finding.VulnerabilityID, fixed_version: finding.FixedVersion.trim() };
}
```
